Scope note added 2026-09-18.  Until this date `data/` fell under NEITHER heading:
the code clause names *.py, notebooks/, Makefile and .github/, and the paper clause
named only paper/.  A Data Availability Statement that said "the data ... under
CC BY 4.0" therefore claimed a licence this file did not grant.  The datasets are
now named explicitly.  Nothing was made more restrictive.
